      "category": "landmark",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "text": "The petroglyphs sit at the base of the Tucson Mountains, just off Picture Rocks Road in Marana, Arizona.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        2
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Web source 1"
      ],
      "source": "https://www.discovermarana.org/blog/coming-face-to-face-with-history-exploring-picture-rocks-petroglyphs/",
      "category": "nature",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "Picture Rocks lies within the Sonoran Desert, a landscape famed for its dramatic geological formations and rich prehistoric heritage.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        6
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Web source 2"
      ],
